ergent dialect or a closely related language.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>Gunaikurnai</b> or Gunai/Kurnai language, also spelt <b>Gunnai</b>, <b>Kurnai</b>, Ganai, Gaanay, or Kurnay <span><i title=\"English pronunciation respelling\"><span style=\"font-size:90%\">KUR</span>-nye</i></span>) is an Australian Aboriginal dialect cluster of the Gunaikurnai people in Gippsland in south-east Victoria. Bidawal was either a divergent dialect or a closely related language.</p>"}